        -7184,
        -1280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## AI Study Review and Weakness Tracking Agent\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives LINE webhook events, filters for image messages, and downloads the submitted study-result image. It uses Gemini-powered AI agents to analyze the image, store the extracted study record in Google Sheets, review accumulated history, and generate personalized feedback. The final response is sent back to the student through the LINE Messaging API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Webhook URL in the LINE Developers console for the target Messaging API channel.\n- Add LINE Messaging API credentials or headers for downloading message content and replying to users, including the channel access token.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet/sheet used for study records and history retrieval.\n- Configure Google Gemini credentials for both AI model nodes and verify the AI prompts/output fields match the Google Sheets columns and LINE reply format.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the image-message filter, AI prompts, Google Sheets schema, and feedback wording to match the subjects, scoring style, or weakness categories you want to track."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "15b1f9d3-f6d2-44d0-8673-ccafc358f729",
