    {
      "id": "28c32b00-61aa-4f63-ab26-73d3e1c3e50b",
      "name": "Learning Trends Analysis Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "maxTries": 5,
      "position": [
        -5104,
        -1120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an AI learning analysis assistant and study coach.\n\nAnalyze the student's study history below, identify recurring weaknesses, recommend review priorities, and create exactly 3 short review questions based on the student's weak areas.\n\nStudy History:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.history, null, 2) }}\n\nRules:\n- Write the entire response in Japanese.\n- Base the analysis only on the provided study history.\n- Do not invent weaknesses, scores, trends, or topics that are not supported by the records.\n- Focus on repeated weaknesses, recurring mistakes, low scores, and repeated review advice.\n- Ignore records where Weak Points is \"Unknown\", \"Not identified\", \"None\", or empty when identifying weaknesses.\n- Avoid repeating the same information in multiple sections.\n- Do not include unnecessary explanations about old records.\n- Do not mention dates unless they are necessary to explain a clear trend.\n- Keep the response concise and suitable for a LINE message.\n- Use plain text only.\n- Do not use Markdown.\n- Do not use asterisks.\n- Do not use bold formatting.\n- Do not use bullet symbols such as \"-\", \"\u2022\", or \"*\".\n- Use short sentences.\n- Keep each analysis section to a maximum of 2 short sentences.\n- Create exactly 3 review questions.\n- Base the review questions only on the identified weak areas and review priorities.\n- Do not copy the original test questions exactly.\n- Keep the difficulty appropriate to the student's recent performance.\n- Do not provide answers to the review questions.\n\nOutput exactly in this format:\n\n[Learning Trend]\n...\n\n[Weak Points]\n...\n\n[Review Priorities]\n...\n\n[Next Action]\n...\n\n[Review Questions]\n1. ...\n2. ...\n3. ...",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
